@startuml
actor User
participant "Browser UI" as UI
participant "JavaScript Analysis" as JS
participant "Spring Boot REST API" as API
participant "ProjectService" as Service
database MySQL
User -> UI: Fill form and Generate Plan
UI -> JS: getFormData()
JS -> JS: validate and calculate preliminary analysis
JS -> UI: Render SVG, dashboard, recommendations
User -> UI: Save project
UI -> JS: saveCurrentProject()
JS -> API: POST /api/projects (JSON)
API -> Service: create(request)
Service -> MySQL: INSERT project + analysis_json
MySQL --> Service: generated ID and row
Service --> API: ProjectResponse
API --> JS: 201 Created + saved project
JS -> UI: Refresh saved projects / toast
@enduml
